  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "opening-letter-base-1",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "chapter": "Opening",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "zh": "他来自加勒比海。商行的账本教会他计算，海上的风暴教会他：一个人的处境，可能在一夜之间被改写。",
        "en": "He came from the Caribbean. A merchant's ledgers taught him to reckon; storms at sea taught him that a life could be rewritten overnight."
      },
      "src": "/audio/en/narrator-a12313d75e6f8d1ecfaa.mp3",
      "generated": true
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-letter-base-2",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "chapter": "Opening",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "zh": "他把所见写成文字。有人读了那篇文章，开始相信，这个年轻人应该得到继续求学的机会。",
        "en": "He put what he had seen into words. People read them and began to believe this young man deserved the chance to continue his education."
      },
      "src": "/audio/en/narrator-4dd04b1bd1275c515920.mp3",
      "generated": true
    },
    {
      "id": "yorktown-command-base-1",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "chapter": "Yorktown",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "zh": "1781 年，法美联军围困约克镇。数年的行军、军令与争执，终于把汉密尔顿带到一座英军堡垒前。",
        "en": "In 1781, French and American forces surrounded Yorktown. Years of marches, dispatches, and disputes brought Hamilton to the foot of a British redoubt."
      },
      "src": "/audio/en/narrator-fd4d6e6f31b71f0617d7.mp3",
      "generated": true
    },
    {
      "id": "yorktown-command-variant-1-1",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "chapter": "Yorktown",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "zh": "1781 年，法美联军围困约克镇。数年的行军与军令，把汉密尔顿带到一座英军堡垒前。",
        "en": "In 1781, French and American forces surrounded Yorktown. Years of marches and dispatches brought Hamilton to the foot of a British redoubt."
      },
      "src": "/audio/en/narrator-63d80505ab69a95e9d50.mp3",
      "generated": true
    },
    {
      "id": "yorktown-surrender-base-1",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "chapter": "Yorktown",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "zh": "汉密尔顿率队攻下十号堡垒，法军攻下相邻的九号堡垒。围城继续收紧。",
        "en": "Hamilton's troops took Redoubt No. 10, while French forces took the neighboring Redoubt No. 9. The siege tightened."
      },
      "src": "/audio/en/narrator-dff0fb0a0936e6af9342.mp3",
      "generated": true
    },
    {
      "id": "yorktown-surrender-base-2",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "chapter": "Yorktown",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "zh": "数日后，英军在约克镇投降。胜利来自许多人的共同作战。战争尚未正式结束，但局势已经改变。",
        "en": "Days later, British forces surrendered at Yorktown. Victory belonged to many people fighting together. The war had not formally ended, but its course had changed."
      },
      "src": "/audio/en/narrator-38e21818aab74754fcea.mp3",
      "generated": true
    },
    {
      "id": "discovery-letter-name-base-1",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "chapter": "Opening",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "zh": "翻过信纸，背面留着几次试写的姓名。墨迹有深有浅，最后一次落笔格外清楚。",
        "en": "On the back of the letter, a name has been written several times. The ink varies in darkness; the final attempt is especially clear."
      },
      "src": "/audio/en/narrator-415afc2242cc5e1ed1ed.mp3",
      "generated": true
    },
    {
      "id": "discovery-tavern-unfinished-draft-base-1",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "chapter": "Tavern",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": {
        "zh": "空桌上留着一张草稿，末行只有半句：如果我们的声音值得被听见……",
        "en": "A draft lies on an empty table. Its final line stops halfway: if our voices deserve to be heard..."
      },
      "src": "/audio/en/narrator-e944d0a1f3274ee0ae5b.mp3",
      "generated": true
    }
  ],
